- Detail-oriented, organized, and able to manage multiple tasks under pressure;

- Positive, adaptable attitude with a strong willingness to learn and grow;

- Proficient in Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint);

- Proficiency in Canva or similar graphic design tools is preferred;

- Video editing skills (e.g., CapCut, Adobe Premiere, JianYing, etc.) are a strong advantage;

- Previous internship or experience in education, marketing, or client services is a plus.

